 Final Numbers 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: October 2026 Global Financial Stability Report ; Chart: Emily Peck/Axios Hedge funds are playing an increasingly important role in the two hottest markets of the moment — U.S. Treasury securities and AI stocks — and they're doing it with a lot of borrowed money, Axios' Emily Peck reports :

 "In times of stress, unwinding that borrowing, or leverage, can turn a sell-off into a crisis that spreads beyond hedge funds into the banking system and the wider economy. "That was the message from a report out Tuesday from the International Monetary Fund, which in its measured way delivered a sharp warning about the growing risk that hedge funds pose to global markets." 
 
